#: kpgp.cpp:182
msgid ""
"Couldn't find PGP executable.\n"
"Please check your PATH is set correctly."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu pronaći PGP izvršnu datoteku.\n"
"Molim provjerite da li je vaš PATH ispravno podešen."

#: kpgp.cpp:201
msgid "OpenPGP Security Check"
msgstr "OpenPGP provjera sigurnosti"

#: kpgp.cpp:209
msgid "Passphrase is too long, it must contain less than 1024 characters."
msgstr "Šifra-fraza je preduga, ona mora imati manje od 1024 karaktera."

#: kpgp.cpp:211
msgid "Out of memory."
msgstr "Memorija potrošena."

#: kpgp.cpp:282
msgid ""
"You just entered an invalid passphrase.\n"
"Do you want to try again, or cancel and view the message undecrypted?"
msgstr ""
"Upravo ste unijeli neispravnu frazu-šifru.\n"
"Želite li pokušati ponovo, ili odustati i pogledati nedešifrovanu poruku?"

#: kpgp.cpp:285 kpgp.cpp:345 kpgp.cpp:375 kpgp.cpp:394 kpgp.cpp:421
#: kpgp.cpp:589 kpgp.cpp:607
msgid "PGP Warning"
msgstr "PGP upozorenje"

#: kpgp.cpp:285 kpgp.cpp:346
msgid "&Retry"
msgstr "&Ponovo"

#: kpgp.cpp:339
msgid ""
"You entered an invalid passphrase.\n"
"Do you want to try again, continue and leave the message unsigned, or cancel "
"sending the message?"
msgstr ""
"Unijeli ste neispravnu frazu-šifru.\n"
"Želite li pokušati ponovo, nastaviti i ostaviti poruku nepotpisanom, ili "
"odustati od slanja poruke?"

#: kpgp.cpp:347 kpgp.cpp:376
msgid "Send &Unsigned"
msgstr "Pošalji &Nepotpisano"

#: kpgp.cpp:369
msgid ""
"_: %1 = 'signing failed' error message\n"
"%1\n"
"Do you want to send the message unsigned, or cancel sending the message?"
msgstr ""
"%1\n"
"Želite li poslati nepotpisanu poruku ili odustati od slanja poruke?"

#: kpgp.cpp:388
msgid ""
"_: %1 = 'bad keys' error message\n"
"%1\n"
"Do you want to encrypt anyway, leave the message as is, or cancel sending "
"the message?"
msgstr ""
"%1\n"
"Želite li ipak šifrovati, ostaviti poruku kakva jeste ili odustati od "
"njenog slanja?"

#: kpgp.cpp:395 kpgp.cpp:608
msgid "Send &Encrypted"
msgstr "Pošalji &Šifrovano"

#: kpgp.cpp:396 kpgp.cpp:590 kpgp.cpp:609
msgid "Send &Unencrypted"
msgstr "Pošalji &Nešifrovano"

#: kpgp.cpp:415
msgid ""
"_: %1 = 'missing keys' error message\n"
"%1\n"
"Do you want to leave the message as is, or cancel sending the message?"
msgstr ""
"%1\n"
"Želite li ostaviti poruku kakva jeste ili odustati od njenog slanja?"

#: kpgp.cpp:422
msgid "&Send as is"
msgstr "&Pošalji kakva jeste"

#: kpgp.cpp:433
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The following error occurred:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Došlo je do sljedeće greške:\n"
"%1"

#: kpgp.cpp:435
msgid ""
"This is the error message of %1:\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"Ovo je poruka greške od %1:\n"
"%2"

#: kpgp.cpp:580
msgid ""
"You didn't select an encryption key for the recipient of this message. "
"Therefore the message will not be encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Niste izabrali ključ za šifrovanje za primatelja ove poruke. Stoga poruka "
"neće biti šifrovana."

#: kpgp.cpp:583
msgid ""
"You didn't select an encryption key for any of the recipients of this "
"message. Therefore the message will not be encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Niste izabrali ključ za šifrovanje niti za jednog od primatelja ove "
"poruke. Stoga poruka neće biti šifrovana."

#: kpgp.cpp:598
msgid ""
"You didn't select an encryption key for one of the recipients. This person "
"will not be able to decrypt the message if you encrypt it."
msgstr ""
"Niste izabrali ključ za šifrovanje za jednog od primatelja ove poruke. Ta "
"osoba neće moći dešifrovati poruku ako je šifrujete."

#: kpgp.cpp:601
msgid ""
"You didn't select encryption keys for some of the recipients. These persons "
"will not be able to decrypt the message if you encrypt it."
msgstr ""
"Niste izabrali ključ za šifrovanje za neke od primatelja ove poruke. Te "
"osobe neće moći dešifrovati poruku ako je šifrujete."

#: kpgp.cpp:874
msgid ""
"This feature is\n"
"still missing"
msgstr ""
"Ova mogućnost još\n"
"nije napravljena"

#: kpgp.cpp:922 kpgp.cpp:957 kpgp.cpp:993
msgid "You either don't have GnuPG/PGP installed or you chose not to use GnuPG/PGP."
msgstr ""
"Ili nemate instaliran GnuPG/PGP ili ste izabrali da ne želite koristiti "
"GnuPG/PGP."

#: kpgp.cpp:1208 kpgp.cpp:1272 kpgp.cpp:1298 kpgpui.cpp:1363 kpgpui.cpp:1375
msgid "Encryption Key Selection"
msgstr "Izbor ključa za šifrovanje"

#: kpgp.cpp:1212
msgid ""
"_: if in your language something like 'key(s)' isn't possible please use the "
"plural in the translation\n"
"There is a problem with the encryption key(s) for \"%1\".\n"
"\n"
"Please re-select the key(s) which should be used for this recipient."
msgstr ""
"Postoji problem sa enkripcijskim ključevima za \"%1\".\n"
"\n"
"Molim ponovo izaberite ključeve koji trebaju biti korišteni za ovog "
"primatelja."

#: kpgp.cpp:1276
msgid ""
"_: if in your language something like 'key(s)' isn't possible please use the "
"plural in the translation\n"
"No valid and trusted OpenPGP key was found for \"%1\".\n"
"\n"
"Select the key(s) which should be used for this recipient."
msgstr ""
"Nije pronađen nijedan ispravan ili povjerljiv OpenPGP ključ za \"%1\".\n"
"\n"
"Izaberite ključeve koji će biti upotrijebljen za ovog primatelja."

#: kpgp.cpp:1302
msgid ""
"_: if in your language something like 'key(s)' isn't possible please use the "
"plural in the translation\n"
"More than one key matches \"%1\".\n"
"\n"
"Select the key(s) which should be used for this recipient."
msgstr ""
"Više od jednog ključa odgovara \"%1\".\n"
"\n"
"Izaberite ključeve koji će biti upotrijebljen za ovog primatelja."

#: kpgpbase2.cpp:136 kpgpbaseG.cpp:141
msgid ""
"Could not find public keys matching the userid(s)\n"
"%1.\n"
"The message is not encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu pronaći javne ključeve koji odgovaraju userid-u\n"
"%1.\n"
"Poruka nije šifrovana."

#: kpgpbase2.cpp:141 kpgpbaseG.cpp:146
msgid ""
"Could not find public keys matching the userid(s)\n"
"%1.\n"
"These persons won't be able to read the message."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu pronaći javne ključeve koji odgovaraju userid-u\n"
"%1.\n"
"Te osobe neće moći čitati poruku."

#: kpgpbase2.cpp:167
msgid ""
"Public keys not certified with trusted signature for userid(s)\n"
"%1.\n"
"The message is not encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Javni ključevi nisu potvrđeni povjerljivim potpisom za userid\n"
"%1.\n"
"Poruka nije šifrovana."

#: kpgpbase2.cpp:173
msgid ""
"Public keys not certified with trusted signature for userid(s)\n"
"%1.\n"
"These persons won't be able to read the message."
msgstr ""
"Javni ključevi nisu potvrđeni povjerljivim potpisom za userid\n"
"%1.\n"
"Te osobe neće moći čitati poruku."

#: kpgpbase2.cpp:194
msgid "Bad passphrase; couldn't sign."
msgstr "Loša šifra-fraza; ne mogu potpisati."

#: kpgpbase2.cpp:202
msgid ""
"Signing failed! Please check your PGP User Identity, the PGP setup and the "
"key rings."
msgstr ""
"Potpisivanje nije uspjelo! Molim provjerite vaš PGP korisnički identite, "
"PGP postavke i key rings."

#: kpgpbase2.cpp:210
msgid "Encryption failed! Please check your PGP setup and the key rings."
msgstr "Šifrovanje nije uspjelo! Molim provjerite vaše PGP postavke i key rings."

